+    Rule:
+    - Crop section 1 to the bbox of all marked template cells, meaning both 4 and 1.
+    - Count 4-connected non-black components in section 2, then repeat the cropped raw
+      template that many times with raw black separator strips between copies.
+    - After tiling, recolor the entire repeated mosaic in one pass: 4 -> foreground
+      swatch, 0 -> background swatch, and 1 stays at the default output color 0.
